    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pup Boy Cowboy</strong> puts you in the boots of Y4M, a bounty-hunter android who once lived a blissful life among humans\u2014even marrying the love of his life. But after her tragic passing (big sadge), Y4M spirals into despair, ready to go out in a blaze of glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just in time, one final mission lands in his lap: an old &quot;friend&quot; has been conducting some questionable experiments on local cows... and things have gone <i>horribly</i> wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you equipped to take them down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a classic arcade-style shooter featuring slick gameplay, goofy enemies, and increasing difficulty that\u2019ll push your reflexes to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can, unlock new skins (only on <i>Very Hard</i>, because why not), and chase high scores to flex how much free time you <i>definitely don\u2019t</i> have. Maybe your friends will finally want to hang out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.poster.avif?t=1746140233\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.webm?t=1746140233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.mp4?t=1746140233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUP BOY COWBOY : Infinite Desert Edition is an enhanced version from the legacy version uploaded in October 2024, with improved gameplay, new secrets, and much more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only this time... It's paid (Lame, I know...) BUT, This version will receive more active support than the legacy one, including new enemy types, new skins, and even more in the future.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pup Boy Cowboy</strong> puts you in the boots of Y4M, a bounty-hunter android who once lived a blissful life among humans\u2014even marrying the love of his life. But after her tragic passing (big sadge), Y4M spirals into despair, ready to go out in a blaze of glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just in time, one final mission lands in his lap: an old &quot;friend&quot; has been conducting some questionable experiments on local cows... and things have gone <i>horribly</i> wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you equipped to take them down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a classic arcade-style shooter featuring slick gameplay, goofy enemies, and increasing difficulty that\u2019ll push your reflexes to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can, unlock new skins (only on <i>Very Hard</i>, because why not), and chase high scores to flex how much free time you <i>definitely don\u2019t</i> have. Maybe your friends will finally want to hang out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.poster.avif?t=1746140233\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.webm?t=1746140233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/80d250eaf1dcbf5379dfd29b92aedd5a.mp4?t=1746140233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUP BOY COWBOY : Infinite Desert Edition is an enhanced version from the legacy version uploaded in October 2024, with improved gameplay, new secrets, and much more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only this time... It's paid (Lame, I know...) BUT, This version will receive more active support than the legacy one, including new enemy types, new skins, and even more in the future.</p>",
